00:16.730 --> 00:18.190
This is really bad.

00:18.820 --> 00:21.410
If they score one more goal, the match is over.

00:22.170 --> 00:24.120
Rin is about to take a free kick now...

00:24.440 --> 00:27.460
Once the ball reaches his feet, there's no way to stop him.

00:27.850 --> 00:31.620
So I need to figure out the match set before the ball gets to him.

00:32.290 --> 00:35.420
- Like the burst Tokimitsu and Rin have in midfield.
- N-Nice shot, Rin-kun. High five...

00:35.420 --> 00:39.560
- N-No?
- I thought their condition would drop.

00:40.240 --> 00:46.140
But Rin probably noticed that Tokimitsu never slowed down before I did.

00:46.750 --> 00:49.890
Rin used his endless, tireless energy

00:49.890 --> 00:53.640
to create a very effective chance in this final stage of the game.

00:54.070 --> 00:57.740
If I had noticed Tokimitsu's ability before Rin did...

00:57.740 --> 01:00.530
...I could have prevented things from happening.

01:00.530 --> 01:01.460
Damn it!

01:01.930 --> 01:06.040
I got so close, but I can't take that final step to catch up to Rin!

02:42.560 --> 02:46.020
Episode 22

02:42.560 --> 02:46.020
Voice

02:46.020 --> 02:49.160
Tch, if I had been in that wall too, I would have jumped without hesitation and...

02:49.560 --> 02:52.970
...blocked him. Damn it.

02:53.580 --> 03:00.490
Rin kicked that free kick over my head because I was in that wall.

03:00.740 --> 03:06.120
If it had been Barou, I'm sure Rin would have scored in a different way.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.690
Wait a minute.

03:08.690 --> 03:14.340
Now I get it. Rin actually used that free kick against me.

03:14.580 --> 03:18.000
So, if I think about it from a different perspective...

03:18.340 --> 03:22.000
If I figure out the "Yoichi Isagi" effect in a different way...

03:23.680 --> 03:25.000
...I can use it to my advantage.

03:25.340 --> 03:29.310
Could this be the new formula I need to beat Rin?

03:29.930 --> 03:32.000
One mistake and we're done.

03:32.000 --> 03:33.430
Give me the ball, okay?

03:34.210 --> 03:35.810
Back off, damn it, you sissy.

03:35.810 --> 03:39.360
I'm telling you! No matter what, pass the ball to me.

03:39.360 --> 03:42.620
I don't care how we do it, but we're closing the gap.

03:43.060 --> 03:45.810
Come on, guys, let's go.

03:46.400 --> 03:50.250
Yeah. It's still too early for our last match.

03:54.530 --> 03:56.960
O-Oh God, here it comes again!

03:56.960 --> 03:59.050
Be a man for once.

03:59.900 --> 04:03.550
Isagi? He's actually listening to me, wow.

04:03.550 --> 04:05.810
Send it over, you donkey!

04:06.880 --> 04:09.340
You're the one who told me to get past this guy, right?

04:09.340 --> 04:11.810
I passed him! Pass to me!

04:12.110 --> 04:15.590
I'm so sorry, but you didn't get past me!

04:15.590 --> 04:19.610
Get out of my way! If you're going to apologize, stop following me, you creep.

04:19.610 --> 04:20.990
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

04:20.990 --> 04:23.060
But I have to win.

04:23.060 --> 04:24.770
Move, kid!

04:24.770 --> 04:28.140
You're terrifying! But I can keep up, no problem.

04:29.770 --> 04:31.560
Is he heading towards the touchline?

04:31.560 --> 04:33.980
Isagi, you... Did you use me as bait?

04:35.440 --> 04:37.370
Nice block, Bachira-kun.

04:38.020 --> 04:40.420
Wait for me, Isagi.

04:42.420 --> 04:44.180
Please don't leave me behind.

04:44.600 --> 04:48.180
Pass it to me, Isagi. Your dribbling won't work in this situation!

04:48.180 --> 04:49.250
Isagi, over here.

04:49.250 --> 04:50.600
Let's play passes!

04:50.600 --> 04:55.680
No. Rin can understand all of you and act accordingly.

04:55.680 --> 04:58.510
I was the one who chose to play with them.

04:58.510 --> 05:01.060
Everyone is focused on who I'm going to pass to right now.

05:01.060 --> 05:04.610
This pass will decide everything.

05:04.610 --> 05:07.060
Now, into that open space.

05:07.520 --> 05:09.220
Run, Chigiri!

05:09.220 --> 05:10.660
Full speed ahead!

05:10.660 --> 05:13.000
When are you going to start running, princess?

05:13.810 --> 05:19.130
We're all running towards the goal mouth for Chigiri to pass to us.

05:19.540 --> 05:23.300
I'm the only one who understands the game and will decide the fate of this match.

05:23.620 --> 05:25.720
While everyone is struggling to find a way...

05:25.720 --> 05:30.550
...I disappear from Rin's field of vision for a second and make my move.

05:31.120 --> 05:34.010
A diagonal run towards the post!

05:34.010 --> 05:35.980
Isagi is running diagonally?

05:36.930 --> 05:38.890
Pass, now...

05:39.390 --> 05:42.560
This is part of the plan I created!

05:42.560 --> 05:45.270
Here it comes! I'm wide open! A huge chance!

05:45.270 --> 05:48.540
My direct shot zone!

05:50.500 --> 05:51.690
Rin?

05:52.180 --> 05:54.160
Damn it! Are you serious?

05:54.520 --> 05:58.790
Somehow, he barely managed to catch up.

05:59.620 --> 06:01.730
He's going to block my shot.

06:05.050 --> 06:06.130
The situation isn't good.

06:06.740 --> 06:08.330
I'm not good enough...

06:09.410 --> 06:11.250
I can't beat this guy.

06:14.230 --> 06:15.230
I've got it.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.510
I tricked you, genius!

06:19.580 --> 06:24.180
That momentary blind spot was created only because you could read me.

06:24.180 --> 06:26.020
And I caught up to your intellect!

06:26.020 --> 06:30.520
This is my true move!

06:30.520 --> 06:35.040
My reverse direct backheel shot!

06:42.180 --> 06:43.830
You really did save it.

06:44.750 --> 06:45.800
Isagi...

06:46.800 --> 06:48.870
I used you, Rin.

06:48.870 --> 06:51.930
I'm going to surpass you.

06:53.220 --> 06:54.670
Take this!

06:54.670 --> 06:57.510
It's tied! You're the best, Isagi!

06:57.510 --> 07:01.140
That was insane. You beat Rin by yourself.

07:01.140 --> 07:05.890
Did you calculate all of that based on what you could see, Isagi?

07:06.120 --> 07:12.420
Yes, but the first thing that came to my mind was to get open and score a goal.

07:12.790 --> 07:17.080
Normally, with this move, even reaching the post would be enough to score.

07:17.430 --> 07:23.420
But I thought that Rin, with his genius eyes and intelligence, would notice it.

07:23.420 --> 07:26.910
So if I had taken the shot, he would have blocked it.

07:26.910 --> 07:31.500
But that also meant that he had to get in front of me to stop me.

07:31.500 --> 07:33.630
So it was a 50/50 chance.

07:34.220 --> 07:38.330
That momentary blind spot was the future of the space I wanted.

07:39.050 --> 07:43.640
This goal only happened thanks to my special formula,

07:43.640 --> 07:48.930
believing that Rin Itoshi could imagine the exact same scene I foresaw!

07:48.930 --> 07:52.480
So if you hadn't scored, you would have given them a chance to counter-attack.

07:52.480 --> 07:54.770
That gamble could have cost us.

07:55.990 --> 08:00.750
No one without the same eyes as Rin could do something like that.

08:00.750 --> 08:06.200
But now the score is tied, right?

08:06.200 --> 08:14.370
Yes. With our final play, we'll crush them and prove we're the better team.

08:14.990 --> 08:17.470
We're still tied. But if we can't win...

08:17.880 --> 08:20.060
Then none of it means anything.

08:26.750 --> 08:31.970
What do I need to do to catch up to Isagi and Rin?

08:33.350 --> 08:41.420
I came to Blue Lock to find monsters... I came to find people I can play soccer with.

08:42.580 --> 08:45.000
There is no other reason.

08:46.290 --> 08:49.880
I just want to play soccer with these two.

08:50.690 --> 08:56.830
But this desire, this ego, isn't enough to get me to where they are.

08:58.500 --> 09:02.490
What else can I possibly want?

09:06.270 --> 09:10.980
What the hell was that just now? They caught up to us.

09:10.980 --> 09:16.490
Laugh, cry, or be magnificent... Whoever scores wins.

09:17.140 --> 09:21.330
All of you, watch my next move carefully.

09:21.790 --> 09:25.870
I'll make you score with your efforts.

09:33.140 --> 09:34.790
Blue Lock
2nd Selection Stage

09:34.840 --> 09:37.500
(4v4 Rivalry Battle)
(Final Play)

09:40.130 --> 09:41.250
Not so fast!

09:41.250 --> 09:43.470
I won't fall for the same trick twice!

09:43.470 --> 09:46.070
Nice, Barou! Focus on Tokimitsu!

09:46.070 --> 09:49.010
The one who looks like a girl, fast but talentless, is here too!

09:49.010 --> 09:50.800
So that's how you see me, is it?

09:50.800 --> 09:52.260
I'll destroy you!

09:52.260 --> 09:57.240
Chigiri and Barou are blocking them from going to the midfield.

09:57.240 --> 09:59.320
In this situation, he'll pass back to Rin.

09:59.320 --> 10:01.770
And that's when I'll intercept!

10:01.770 --> 10:03.490
Fifty-fifty!

10:04.580 --> 10:06.710
Damn it! We were so close.

10:08.120 --> 10:11.210
A high ball? For Aryu?

10:11.210 --> 10:13.160
A battle for the first touch.

10:13.470 --> 10:17.040
If I jump at its highest point, I'll lose, so I'll time my jump...

10:17.510 --> 10:19.090
...and take the ball while it's in the air!

10:19.860 --> 10:21.880
How arrogant. But at the same time...

10:22.510 --> 10:23.600
...pathetic.

10:23.600 --> 10:25.260
Did he take it back?

10:25.260 --> 10:27.020
His legs are too long.

10:27.020 --> 10:28.510
His body is like a mop stick!

10:29.370 --> 10:31.390
Damn it. They're coming!

10:31.390 --> 10:34.230
I won't let him play comfortably!

10:34.230 --> 10:37.590
Isagi Yoichi, you're blocking me perfectly.

10:37.590 --> 10:39.610
But this place is wide open!

10:42.010 --> 10:44.620
Right now, I'm being tested.

10:45.110 --> 10:47.000
What should I do?

10:47.330 --> 10:50.580
Should I pass? No, if I go through them...

10:50.580 --> 10:51.730
What then?

10:52.230 --> 10:55.340
What do they want from me?

10:55.900 --> 10:58.540
Tell me, monster.

10:59.570 --> 11:02.570
What do I need to do?

11:02.570 --> 11:04.400
To make those two see me,

11:06.410 --> 11:08.510
what can I do?

11:08.510 --> 11:10.230
Well done, slow guy!

11:10.700 --> 11:12.980
If you're going to stand there scared, go see a fortune teller.

11:12.980 --> 11:14.610
This is a battlefield!

11:15.400 --> 11:17.190
Loose ball...

11:17.190 --> 11:17.980
Back off!

11:17.980 --> 11:18.770
Oh no!

11:18.770 --> 11:19.440
Counter-attack!

11:21.120 --> 11:22.370
You're not yourself at all.

11:22.890 --> 11:24.760
Are you losing on purpose?

11:25.330 --> 11:31.000
I mean, you don't think you'll be chosen even if you lose, right?

11:31.300 --> 11:34.720
Honestly, with the state you're in now, I wouldn't pick you to survive.

11:36.710 --> 11:38.400
If we win, I'll take Rin.

11:38.860 --> 11:41.420
Isagi probably feels the same way.

11:46.070 --> 11:48.710
If we lose, will I not be chosen?

11:49.500 --> 11:54.110
Then I won't be able to play soccer with Isagi or Rin.

11:55.110 --> 11:56.040
No way...

11:57.210 --> 11:59.010
No, no, no!

11:59.910 --> 12:01.140
This can't be...

12:02.300 --> 12:03.700
It won't happen!

12:04.650 --> 12:07.870
Pass, Barou! Don't try to mess with Tokimitsu!

12:07.870 --> 12:11.830
Hmph! I'm already sick of this slimy guy.

12:11.830 --> 12:13.620
I'll take it back with interest, just so you know!

12:14.830 --> 12:17.410
Nice pass. Wall pass!

12:17.700 --> 12:19.410
So this is how you want to play, you donkey?

12:19.410 --> 12:20.850
Are you ready, King?

12:21.350 --> 12:24.210
Because we've been stealing the ball from each other the whole match...

12:24.210 --> 12:28.170
...we can now play together and overcome Rin's foresight and Tokimitsu's quickness.

12:28.170 --> 12:29.130
Once more!

12:29.130 --> 12:31.220
Anti-combo, one-two wall pass!

12:31.220 --> 12:32.850
No way! Come back!

12:32.850 --> 12:34.350
They're zigzagging.

12:34.350 --> 12:36.230
Alright! That's it!

12:36.230 --> 12:38.320
We're going to score on the final play.

12:43.650 --> 12:46.610
No... I don't want to stay behind.

12:47.030 --> 12:51.030
My feelings, my ego... None of that matters.

12:51.030 --> 12:53.150
I'd die if it means winning!

12:53.850 --> 12:57.200
What I found in Blue Lock...

12:57.620 --> 13:00.090
I don't want to lose any of it!

13:00.740 --> 13:04.760
I don't want to lose the friends I found.

13:06.220 --> 13:12.190
I don't want to be alone like I used to be.

13:21.300 --> 13:23.380
Part of growing up is

13:23.380 --> 13:26.860
not being able to believe in the things you want to believe in.

13:26.860 --> 13:29.660
So they pretend not to hear the voice inside them.

13:29.660 --> 13:32.700
Until eventually, they can no longer hear what it's saying.

13:32.970 --> 13:37.910
What you're trying to believe in is very important.

13:38.690 --> 13:41.410
What I'm trying to believe in?

13:42.400 --> 13:45.370
What am I trying to believe in?

13:47.280 --> 13:48.860
What did I believe in?

13:53.380 --> 13:54.500
Monsters?

13:55.950 --> 13:57.040
Friends?

13:57.880 --> 14:00.300
Meguru, the answer is...

14:01.070 --> 14:03.690
This is your true inner voice.

14:05.370 --> 14:08.150
My true inner voice?

14:23.330 --> 14:25.690
Remember once more.

14:26.260 --> 14:27.500
To my true inner voice!

14:28.590 --> 14:30.250
I want to believe!

14:31.370 --> 14:33.220
Unexpected pressure from Bachira!

14:33.970 --> 14:35.630
Rin will use this opening.

14:35.630 --> 14:38.980
Over there! Go one step faster and pass to Chigiri on the right wing.

14:39.800 --> 14:42.800
And now, it's time to reach the peak.

14:43.050 --> 14:45.270
Wait. Wait a minute.

14:45.660 --> 14:47.240
I don't want this to end.

14:47.240 --> 14:48.320
I won't allow it!

14:48.320 --> 14:50.860
I'm going to win the Best Supporting Actor award.

14:50.860 --> 14:51.950
A chest pass?

14:51.950 --> 14:53.150
Your turn now...

14:54.100 --> 14:55.140
Striker.

14:55.530 --> 14:58.000
You guys are the best.

14:58.370 --> 15:00.370
Now it's my turn.

15:00.370 --> 15:01.830
The space is tight, but I can score!

15:02.540 --> 15:04.050
Wait for me, Isagi.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.620
One more time...

15:05.620 --> 15:06.870
This is as far as you go!

15:07.160 --> 15:08.660
Just one more time...

15:09.590 --> 15:12.590
Victory is ours!

15:13.260 --> 15:15.720
Give me one more chance!

15:22.850 --> 15:25.860
Rin? Seriously, how...

15:35.370 --> 15:42.780
And so, Bachira Meguru began to listen only to himself.

15:42.780 --> 15:44.500
Plain but glamorous, Rin.

15:44.500 --> 15:46.240
C-Counter-attack!

15:47.950 --> 15:50.880
Stop. Don't come out now, monster.

15:51.230 --> 15:52.470
When you were on the field...

15:53.500 --> 15:56.800
...I was searching for you without knowing it.

15:57.660 --> 16:00.940
You were always there, you never left me alone.

16:01.530 --> 16:05.370
Thanks to you, I could keep believing in myself.

16:06.590 --> 16:12.110
But while searching for you, I lost my connection with myself,

16:12.730 --> 16:16.150
and I started playing soccer to find someone like me.

16:16.650 --> 16:20.400
That's why I can't go any further with you.

16:22.400 --> 16:23.460
Disappear.

16:24.820 --> 16:27.220
I'm begging you. Please go.

16:27.220 --> 16:30.550
I don't need you anymore.

16:32.120 --> 16:35.840
If I let someone get past me, the game is over. This is my last chance!

16:38.640 --> 16:41.660
If only there was someone there to get behind Isagi.

16:41.660 --> 16:42.420
Damn it.

16:42.420 --> 16:46.640
It's so hard to break the habit of searching for the "monster".

16:47.090 --> 16:51.690
You were my only hope when playing soccer with me.

16:52.370 --> 16:57.570
But somehow, I turned you into a curse that blocks me.

16:57.780 --> 17:02.080
Playing soccer with you became my reason for living.

17:02.370 --> 17:07.660
Then I came to Blue Lock and met Isagi, my real monster.

17:08.150 --> 17:10.150
It felt so good that

17:11.050 --> 17:14.670
playing soccer with Isagi became my reason to exist.

17:15.790 --> 17:19.590
I became someone who can't play soccer without Isagi.

17:20.380 --> 17:24.210
If I don't break this curse, I can't move forward.

17:24.640 --> 17:26.590
I can't hear my own voice.

17:26.590 --> 17:29.300
Bachira-kun! I'm open! Pass!

17:29.300 --> 17:30.970
Shut up. Get out of my face!

17:30.970 --> 17:33.060
I won't give you the ball anymore.

17:33.330 --> 17:34.650
I'll go and score myself!

17:35.430 --> 17:39.240
What the hell is this wild dribbling style?

17:39.660 --> 17:42.990
And I've never seen Bachira like this before.

17:43.220 --> 17:44.800
Something has changed.

17:44.800 --> 17:46.960
He's not like he used to be!

17:46.960 --> 17:49.030
Stop him, Chigiri! You can catch up to him!

17:49.030 --> 17:52.320
He's so slow, it's child's play! I won't let him get past me!

17:52.700 --> 17:53.460
Bachira!

17:53.850 --> 17:55.630
Over here! I'm moving forward!

17:55.630 --> 17:57.630
I said I won't pass anymore!

17:59.460 --> 18:00.640
A double feint?

18:01.190 --> 18:03.230
Did you turn on rage mode, Bowl Cut?

18:03.230 --> 18:05.230
If you can't get past him, they'll win, Bachira-kun.

18:05.470 --> 18:08.380
Shut up! This isn't an attack.

18:08.380 --> 18:10.550
This is an awakening to break the curse!

18:14.810 --> 18:16.020
He pulled off a third feint too?

18:16.020 --> 18:16.690
Damn it.

18:16.690 --> 18:19.660
His moves are too good. If this keeps up, he'll beat us.

18:19.660 --> 18:21.420
No one on this field right now can predict

18:21.420 --> 18:25.360
that he's the joker in the deck, no doubt!

18:25.360 --> 18:28.230
He's running alone. We all have to hold him!

18:28.230 --> 18:28.820
Got it.

18:28.820 --> 18:29.610
Hold him!

18:30.820 --> 18:34.830
We're playing him three-on-one. This will work! We can get the ball!

18:35.380 --> 18:38.220
Rin? His position...

18:38.220 --> 18:40.410
It's so easy for Bachira to pass to him.

18:40.410 --> 18:44.390
When Rin gets the ball, he'll run straight for the goal!

18:44.390 --> 18:46.490
But I know that too!

18:46.490 --> 18:48.350
I'll intercept the pass!

18:48.350 --> 18:49.960
Half of it is wide open!

18:49.960 --> 18:51.550
The price of his anger!

18:51.550 --> 18:53.960
So if we can get the ball, this is a huge chance for us.

18:53.960 --> 18:59.810
You're all buzzing around me like little bugs...

19:00.130 --> 19:03.200
Stop distracting me, you pests!

19:04.570 --> 19:05.910
This is so reckless, Bachira-kun!

19:05.910 --> 19:07.860
Is he still planning to go alone?

19:08.290 --> 19:09.780
I get it.

19:09.780 --> 19:12.410
Someone Rin can't predict.

19:13.430 --> 19:16.020
The final piece of "all or nothing"...

19:16.020 --> 19:19.830
To beat Rin, I have to defeat that monster!

19:20.790 --> 19:22.330
How long has it been?

19:23.060 --> 19:27.590
I forgot I could play as I want. Everything has changed now.

19:28.040 --> 19:30.590
You should try to become one with the ball too.

19:30.590 --> 19:32.690
Then you can do amazing things!

19:32.910 --> 19:35.560
There's nothing more fun than soccer!

19:36.690 --> 19:37.920
That's right.

19:37.920 --> 19:41.020
Even alone, I had so much fun.

19:41.690 --> 19:44.160
I chased the ball until it got dark.

19:45.520 --> 19:47.300
Just like back then,

19:47.890 --> 19:50.460
becoming one with the ball means everything to me.

19:50.840 --> 19:53.920
I don't need any other reason to play soccer.

19:54.500 --> 19:59.640
There's nothing more fun than this!

20:00.850 --> 20:03.540
Even if I'm mocked for being weird...

20:03.540 --> 20:05.790
Even if I end up alone again...

20:05.790 --> 20:07.390
Even if I have no friends...

20:09.210 --> 20:10.260
I'll fight.

20:10.260 --> 20:14.490
With this passion burning inside me, I'll lose myself!

20:15.800 --> 20:17.350
No, you won't!

20:19.490 --> 20:20.520
That's not you.

20:21.970 --> 20:24.350
I will become the monster!

20:25.650 --> 20:28.910
Thank you for staying by my side until now.

20:30.820 --> 20:33.530
If no one else is left at the end of all this, I'll be sad, but

20:35.310 --> 20:40.180
from now on, I'll dance alone.

20:41.000 --> 20:43.380
Bye bye, monster.

20:45.090 --> 20:49.210
Bye bye, Isagi, the guy who was my soccer friend until now.

20:50.920 --> 20:53.730
Damn it! I can't stop him.

20:56.390 --> 20:59.840
I have to take back the soccer I played alone!

21:06.100 --> 21:08.290
This is what will wake me up...

21:14.200 --> 21:16.000
The ego of "going back to the beginning"!

21:21.450 --> 21:22.670
Isagi?

21:22.690 --> 21:25.160
I knew you would do this, Bachira.

21:25.160 --> 21:27.850
I knew you would go alone.

